00:41:08.054 --> 00:41:09.720
I think that if your
company is starting

00:41:09.720 --> 00:41:11.520
to engage in thinking about
building in App Maker,

00:41:11.520 --> 00:41:12.480
dive in by all means.

00:41:12.480 --> 00:41:14.850
But accelerate the process
by bringing in people who've

00:41:14.850 --> 00:41:15.580
been doing this for a while.

00:41:15.580 --> 00:41:16.180
They know the pitfalls.

00:41:16.180 --> 00:41:17.471
They know the ways to go do it.

00:41:17.471 --> 00:41:18.390
Best practices.

00:41:18.390 --> 00:41:19.260
It's a great story.

00:41:19.260 --> 00:41:20.860
So I'm actually really
glad you're starting.

00:41:20.860 --> 00:41:22.225
That was a key part of
our long term strategy.

00:41:22.225 --> 00:41:22.620
JAME FERREIRA: Great.

00:41:22.620 --> 00:41:23.590
Thank you.

00:41:23.590 --> 00:41:24.160
Thank you.

00:41:24.160 --> 00:41:24.580
Thank you.

