00:41:30.562 --> 00:41:33.020
GEVA RECHAV: As we head towards
the end of our talk we want

00:41:33.020 --> 00:41:34.880
to mention what's
next for the product,

00:41:34.880 --> 00:41:39.740
and what's next for you in the
audience, and your company's.

00:41:39.740 --> 00:41:42.310
So you've seen a
lot of functionality

00:41:42.310 --> 00:41:44.350
that we've presented here today.

00:41:44.350 --> 00:41:46.420
And we want to tell
you, what are the three

00:41:46.420 --> 00:41:49.750
main themes that we are focusing
on before general availability

00:41:49.750 --> 00:41:51.310
later this year.

00:41:51.310 --> 00:41:54.235
One area where we
see a lot of demand

00:41:54.235 --> 00:41:57.610
is to connect App
Maker, the platform,

00:41:57.610 --> 00:41:59.710
to a lot of data
sources that you already

00:41:59.710 --> 00:42:02.980
have in your companies and you
would benefit from building

00:42:02.980 --> 00:42:05.210
business apps around those.

00:42:05.210 --> 00:42:10.660
So we are actually already
developing some ways

00:42:10.660 --> 00:42:13.090
to connect these
external third party data

00:42:13.090 --> 00:42:15.359
sources to our platform.

00:42:15.359 --> 00:42:16.900
And we believe that
this would really

00:42:16.900 --> 00:42:23.460
ease the migration of many non-G
Suite environments to G Suite.

00:42:23.460 --> 00:42:26.870
The second theme space
that we're working on

00:42:26.870 --> 00:42:30.630
is to make the product
even faster and easier.

00:42:30.630 --> 00:42:32.870
So we are going to provide
more templates and ready

00:42:32.870 --> 00:42:34.070
to use apps.

00:42:34.070 --> 00:42:36.620
We're also looking
to have modules

00:42:36.620 --> 00:42:39.650
that are part of apps that
you could use and actually

00:42:39.650 --> 00:42:42.740
build your own apps in
a faster and easier way.

00:42:42.740 --> 00:42:44.660
So you can mix and match
functionalities that

00:42:44.660 --> 00:42:47.060
are common to several apps.

00:42:47.060 --> 00:42:51.380
And that would make everything
even easier, more useful,

00:42:51.380 --> 00:42:52.760
and faster.

00:42:52.760 --> 00:42:55.340
Third theme is to
create an ecosystem.

00:42:55.340 --> 00:42:57.770
So we've heard from
Mario, for example,

00:42:57.770 --> 00:43:00.950
that in large companies,
different departments,

00:43:00.950 --> 00:43:04.580
different plants tend
to have similar needs.

00:43:04.580 --> 00:43:07.610
And they may, you know,
grassroots develop

00:43:07.610 --> 00:43:11.490
