apps multiple times.

00:43:11.490 --> 00:43:15.110
So if we have a good
way to engage, like,

00:43:15.110 --> 00:43:17.690
a broad audience inside
the company with what's

00:43:17.690 --> 00:43:21.580
being developed by other
people, that can be very useful.

00:43:21.580 --> 00:43:24.110
And we are looking
at the best way

00:43:24.110 --> 00:43:27.470
to let you share your
applications with others

00:43:27.470 --> 00:43:28.970
inside the company.

00:43:28.970 --> 00:43:31.310
And also with the broader
app maker community.

00:43:31.310 --> 00:43:34.310
So any company that
is using app maker

00:43:34.310 --> 00:43:37.950
